
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For My Love ❤️</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff758c, #ff7eb3, #ffc3a0);
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}
.card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.94);
  padding: 35px 25px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  max-width: 390px;
  width: 100%;
  box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(120,0,50,.2);
}
.heart {
  font-size: 65px;
  animation: beat 1s infinite;
}
h1 { color: #e84373; }
p { color: #555; line-height: 1.7; }
button {
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 15px 28px;
  background: #ff4f81;
  color: white;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin-top: 15px;
}
#message {
  display: none;
  margin-top: 25px;
  animation: fade 1.2s;
}
#message h2 { color: #e84373; }
@keyframes beat {
  50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
}
@keyframes fade {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="heart">❤️</div>
  <h1>Hi, My Love! 🥰</h1>
  <p>I have a little surprise for you.</p>
  <p>There's something I want you to know...</p>

  <button onclick="showLove()">Pislita ko, Love ❤️</button>

  <div id="message">
    <h2>I LOVE YOU SO MUCH! ❤️</h2>
    <p>
      Ikaw akong favorite person, my love.
      Thank you for being part of my life.
      I will keep choosing you, loving you,
      and making memories with you.
      Forever and always, ikaw ra. ❤️😘
    </p>
    <div class="heart">💗</div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function showLove() {
  document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
